# The Fantasticar: "you may sacrifice The Fantasticar. If you do, create four 4/4 ... Construct tokens." Lotus (1),
# Fantasticar (2), Mox Ruby (3) and Mox Sapphire (4) are Bot1's noncreature spells; with the fourth spell's abilities on the
# stack Bot1 casts Abrade (a fifth spell) on the Fantasticar and destroys it. It is gone when the ability resolves, so
# there is nothing to sacrifice and no Construct is created.

[Bot1 Deck]
The Fantasticar
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Abrade
Mountain
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

